      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `helipilot` directory structure is prepared for helipilot-based boards like `buccaneer` and `gwendolin`.\n\nIf I\u0027m not mistaken you need to:\n- Create `gwendolin.dts` file under `fpmcu/helipilot` directory. Your current `gwendolin.dts` looks good, just move it under `helipilot` directory.\n- Add gwendolin\u0027s `dev_key.pem`. You can create directory to keep keys if you want.\n- Add `gwendolin` to `BUILD.py`. You just need to adjust some paths.\n\nPlease note:\n- You reuse `helipilot/prj.conf` file. It only contains configs that are common for all helipilot-based boards.\n- You do not need to create `CONFIG_BOARD_GWENDOLIN` in `fpmcu/Kconfig`, it\u0027s the same as `CONFIG_BOARD_HELIPILOT`. If you think it\u0027s confusing, you can change `CONFIG_BOARD_HELIPILOT` to `CONFIG_BASEBOARD_HELIPILOT`.",
      "parentUuid": "019ba599_0962299b",
