      "message": "Could you move `gwendolin.dts` under `fpmcu/helipilot`, please? Also I see that `helipilot/gwendolin/gpio.dtsi` is the same as `helipilot/gpio.dtsi`. Could you remove the former file?\n\nAlso I noticed that `helipilot/gwendolin/soc.dtsi` is almost the same as `helipilot/soc.dtsi` (you removed code/data split change). The idea behind changing code/data split in `helipilot/soc.dts` was to provide some kind of default split, but I see that each board redefines the split again, so I think, you can remove code/data split change from `helipilot/soc.dtsi` and also reuse that file.\n\nIf you have some questions please let me know.",
